1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:05,600
When did you last feel like yourself?

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:09,400
Morning, noon, night.

3
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:11,700
Same chair… same you.

4
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:17,600
Everyone seems to know where they're going.

5
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:23,600
Until one day, the face in the mirror feels like a stranger's.

6
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:25,700
So many roads.

7
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:29,600
But your feet won't move.

8
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:32,000
The world feels too big…

9
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,200
for one tired person.

10
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:38,600
You're not broken.

11
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:41,600
You've just been tired… for too long.

12
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:47,600
What are you really chasing?

13
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:53,600
Maybe the answer doesn't have to come tonight.

14
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:57,300
Just staying here… is enough.

15
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:59,200
If it feels heavy, talk to someone you trust.
